for cell in cells:
 c=contrasts[cell+'::focused_continuation-minus-ordinary_continuation'];e=c['exact'];lo,hi=c['token_interval95'];text.append(f"| {cell} | {100*e['point']:+.2f} [{100*e['lower']:+.2f}, {100*e['upper']:+.2f}] | {e['gains']} / {e['losses']} | {100*c['token_delta']:+.3f} [{100*lo:+.3f}, {100*hi:+.3f}] | {c['token_gains']} / {c['token_regressions']} |")
text.append('\nDecision checks are fully enumerated in `score_r1.json`. Finance safeguards are prospective point-loss limits of 0.05 token percentage points against ordinary and frozen B1 on each target; passing them is not a formal noninferiority claim.\n')
